                <invention-title lang="de">ELEKTROCHIRURGISCHE VORRICHTUNG MIT BELEUCHTUNGS- UND RAUCHABZUGSFUNKTIONEN</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">DISPOSITIF ÉLECTROCHIRURGICAL AVEC ÉLÉMENTS D'ÉCLAIRAGE ET D'ÉVACUATION DE FUMÉE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">ELECTROSURGICAL DEVICE WITH ILLUMINATION AND SMOKE EVACUATION FEATURES</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An electrosurgical device is provided. The electrosurgical device comprises a housing defining an interior bore. The electrosurgical device further comprises a shaft 126 coupled to the housing. The shaft has a longitudinal axis extending from a proximal end of the shaft to a distal end 726B of the shaft. The electrosurgical device still further comprises an electrosurgical electrode 128 coupled to the shaft. The shaft comprises a shaft wall having an inner surface and an outer surface, wherein the inner surface of the shaft wall defines a smoke evacuation channel that extends from the distal end of the shaft to the proximal end of the shaft. The shaft further comprises an electrode receptacle 737 that couples the electrosurgical electrode to the shaft, wherein the electrode receptacle extends across the smoke evacuation channel in a direction that is transverse to the longitudinal axis of the shaft such that electrode receptacle partitions the smoke evacuation channel into a plurality of smoke inlets 772 at the distal end of the shaft. The electrode receptacle defines an aperture configured to receive the electrosurgical electrode .</p>
            </abstract>
